- **Overall score is 8.4, just under the 8.5 floor.** I scored each dimension separately and did not adjust anything toward the floor. Evidence and durability are 8.4, Enneagram 8.1, originality 8.6, writing 8.3, hook 9.0, discoverability 8.0. Enneagram is held down because the case against Type 7 rests on two single quotes, and the case against Type 3 rests on two patterns from press interviews.

